entries[102812] = { ["name"] = "Grievous Gladiator's Mooncloth Gloves", ["text"] = "Season 15\nBinds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n1546 Armor\n+1,736 Stamina\n+1,078 Intellect\n+692 Spirit\n+ 772 Haste\n+ 462 PvP Power\n\nBlue Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 60 Intellect\n\nDurability 60 / 60\nClasses: Priest\nRequires any Horde race\nRequires Level 90\nEquip: Reduces the cooldown of your Psychic Scream ability by 3 sec.\n\nGladiator's Investiture (0/5)\nGladiator's Mooncloth Gloves\nGladiator's Mooncloth Helm\nGladiator's Mooncloth Leggings\nGladiator's Mooncloth Robe\nGladiator's Mooncloth Mantle\n(2) Set : Increases PvP power by 500.\n(2) Set : When you cast Prayer of Mending, the initial target is blessed with a Holy Spark increasing the healing done by your next Flash Heal, Greater Heal or Holy Word: Serenity by 50% for 10 sec.\n(4) Set : Increases PvP Power by 1000.\n(4) Set : Reduces the cooldown of your Chakra to 5 sec. During Spirit Shell, the mana cost of your Flash Heal is reduced by 50%.\nSell Price:" }
